<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pacasmayo cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pacasmayo cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert Fleming analyst Ben Uglow has cut his rating for Peruvian cement company Cementos Norte Pacasmayo SA to hold from buy</p>
<p>-- In a May 8 report, he wrote that first quarter earnings had advanced sharply because of stronger pricing and improved efficiency.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
